{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":5},"Homéopathie : une autre voie","L’homéopathie ne connaît pas de frontières. Elle est utilisée quotidiennement par 200 millions de personnes dans le monde entier. Ce film de William Suerinck la montre à l’œuvre, aussi bien en médecine humaine que pour soigner animaux et plantes. Des hommes, femmes, médecins, vétérinaires, agriculteurs, éleveurs parlent de cette thérapeutique fascinante et efficace qu’ils ont choisie par amour du vivant. Des scientifiques s’expriment sur les recherches les plus récentes au sujet de la mémoire de l’eau.",[4],"high rank employment",{"type":6,"id":7,"slug":8,"title":9,"release":11,"filmType":15,"directors":16,"genre":23,"media":26,"synopsis":29,"production":30,"characters":33,"roles":34,"awards":39,"tags":3},"Film","FR2019_224","fr2019-224-homeopathie-une-autre-voie",{"native":1,"english":10},"",{"type":12,"date":13,"year":14},"Theatrical release",null,0,"Documentary",[17],{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":14,"deathYear":14,"gender":20,"nationality":21,"awards":22},"William Suerinck","william-suerinck","Male identifying","France",[],[24,25],"Documentary – Participatory mode","Documentary – Observational mode",{"posterUrl":27,"trailerUrl":28},"https://www.inhfparis.com/wp-content/uploads/2019/09/Capture-d%E2%80%99e%CC%81cran-2019-10-15-a%CC%80-09.32.12-1-466x510.png","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OL6V5vqfcSs&t=755s",{"native":2,"english":10},[31],{"country":21,"share":32},"Majority coproducer",[],[35],{"person":36,"role":38},{"id":18,"slug":19,"name":18,"birthYear":14,"deathYear":14,"gender":20,"nationality":21,"awards":37},[],"Director of the film",[]],"uses":{"params":["slug"]}}]}
